  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRchat really needs to do something about the fact its platform is slowly but surely becoming \"ERP simulator\" with no proper age verification system.\n\nEspecially with the release of the Quest, I am seeing more and more users under the age of 16 joining the game in VR, and of course there's always been a huge population of underage players in desktop mode since the days of knuckles.\n\nVRchat has slowly but surely become a really dangerous place for minors since it essentially encourages the possibility of intimacy and ERP with underage people simply by inaction.\n\nThe amount of stories I've heard of underage people lying or remaining mute so they can ERP, or worse yet adults knowingly engaging with minors is unacceptable.\n\nBy VRchat not actively moderating the amount of lewding, binge drinking, and shitty behavior in the game it's forced out people who don't want that experience and the userbase that's left is becoming more akin to 4chan, and even 4chan has pro-active moderation.",
